    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24447" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δημοσι-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>confiscate,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.68
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Procop.
				<u>Arc.</u>
				11
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, of the Ager Publicus at Rome, <i>to be converted to
				public use,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				8.74
			</span></i>; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεδημοσιωμέναι γυναῖκες</span>”
				<i>prostitutes,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.519e
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>publish,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				8.55
			</span></i>:—usu. 
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Sph.</u>
				232d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.507f
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>register</i> a deed, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρὰ τῷ ἀρχιδικαστῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Sammelb.</u>
					4651.6
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>:—usu. 
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				50.5
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>, etc.</div>
